One <111> dumbbell in a bcc crystal.

  sh insert.sh     builds an 8 x 8 x 8 bcc cell (1024 atoms) and inserts the
                   dumbbell at site (1,1,1): 1025 atoms in formd_new.str
  sh clean.sh      removes the files produced by the run

The same as 001_SIA_110 with defect type 2 instead of 1. To change the cell,
the sites or the defect type, edit the three short blocks of insert.sh. Keep
the lattice parameter at 2.8553.
